@* Base samples landing — index of the WASP C#-on-IC demos. Rendered inside
   the app sidebar shell (WrapWithSidebar). *@

<PageTitle>WASP — C# samples on the Internet Computer</PageTitle>

<div class="home">
    <header class="home-hero">
        <h1 class="home-title">WASP <span class="home-title-em">·</span> C# on the Internet Computer</h1>
        <p class="home-lead">
            ASP.NET Core and Blazor, AOT-compiled to <code>wasm32-wasi</code> and served
            straight from a single canister — no backend to trust. Each card below is a
            live sample running on-chain.
        </p>
        <div class="home-meta">Served from <code>@WaspSample.BlazorWasp.AdminService.CanisterIdText()</code></div>
    </header>

    <div class="home-grid">
        <a class="home-card" href="/counter">
            <span class="home-card-k">State</span>
            <h3>Counter</h3>
            <p>A persistent int32 counter in stable memory, polled live over the query path.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="home-card" href="/place">
            <span class="home-card-k">Realtime</span>
            <h3>Place</h3>
            <p>An r/place-style shared pixel canvas — every pixel a signed write, the grid in stable memory.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="home-card" href="/chat">
            <span class="home-card-k">Messaging</span>
            <h3>Chat</h3>
            <p>Multi-room chat with rich text, reactions and Internet Identity sign-in. Messages live on-chain.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="home-card" href="/tetris">
            <span class="home-card-k">Game</span>
            <h3>Tetris</h3>
            <p>A Blazor WebAssembly game with an on-chain high-score leaderboard.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="home-card" href="/crm">
            <span class="home-card-k">App</span>
            <h3>CRM</h3>
            <p>A small CRM (contacts, companies, deals, tasks) — a Blazor WASM SPA over canister state.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="home-card" href="/weather">
            <span class="home-card-k">Demo</span>
            <h3>Weather</h3>
            <p>The classic forecast sample, generated once and cached permanently in stable memory.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="home-card" href="/stable">
            <span class="home-card-k">Inspect</span>
            <h3>Stable memory</h3>
            <p>Browse the canister's certified stable-memory regions and the data each service owns.</p>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .home { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
    .home-hero { margin-bottom: 2.25rem; }
    .home-title { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: #f2f3f5; }
    .home-title-em { color: #5B8CFF; }
    .home-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #b5bac1; max-width: 60ch; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .home-lead code, .home-meta code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 0.05em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px; color: #d7dadf; }
    .home-meta { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #80848e; }
    .home-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(248px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .home-card { display: block; padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.35rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease; }
    .home-card:hover { border-color: rgba(91,140,255,0.5); background: rgba(91,140,255,0.06); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .home-card-k { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 600; color: #5B8CFF; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .home-card h3 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #f2f3f5; }
    .home-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #b5bac1; }
</style>
